    "type": "game",
    "name": "This Is My House",
    "steam_appid": 3627360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Is My House is a 5 player asymmetric physics-based team vs team game. In this game you are playing as either a Ghost or a Ghost Hunter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore various locations, defending your territory as a ghastly spirit or raiding it as a curious Ghost Hunter.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghosts:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is to eliminate all the hunters, and stop them from completing objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have skills and abilities to hunt the hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a Revenant to become a stealth based hunter, which deals massive damage with backstabs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spec into Poltergeist to become a deadly prop-thrower and annihilate those who trespass.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunters:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have randomized objectives and get to compete or help the other hunters in escaping alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have access to various equipment to aid you in the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones with 'Spiritbombs' to find and hunt down evil spirits. (Or your own team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosses to ward off specters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REM Pods to place and keep track of the ghost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salt shakers to sprinkle salt to lock down areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game to your liking in the lobby settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize aspects like health, equipment points, objectives, number of ghosts.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Is My House is a 5 player asymmetric physics-based team vs team game. In this game you are playing as either a Ghost or a Ghost Hunter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore various locations, defending your territory as a ghastly spirit or raiding it as a curious Ghost Hunter.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghosts:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is to eliminate all the hunters, and stop them from completing objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have skills and abilities to hunt the hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a Revenant to become a stealth based hunter, which deals massive damage with backstabs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spec into Poltergeist to become a deadly prop-thrower and annihilate those who trespass.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunters:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have randomized objectives and get to compete or help the other hunters in escaping alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have access to various equipment to aid you in the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones with 'Spiritbombs' to find and hunt down evil spirits. (Or your own team)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosses to ward off specters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REM Pods to place and keep track of the ghost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salt shakers to sprinkle salt to lock down areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game to your liking in the lobby settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize aspects like health, equipment points, objectives, number of ghosts.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This Is My House is a 5 player asymmetric PvP game. Play as a team of hunters searching for treasure. Or play as the ghost to stop the hunters...",
